  "description": "The concept of baking cookies is a common domestic activity, often associated with home baking, patience, and anticipation. The meme humorously implies that waiting for cookies to bake is a mundane, relatable experience that can induce impatience, contrasting it with the solemnity of the religious ceremony depicted. This requires background knowledge of everyday domestic life and the cultural association of baking with comfort and anticipation.",
